+def q09_opposing_neighbor_count(b:Battle,u:BattleUnit)->int:
+    """Original hex $80D1 and $C00A compare battle slot bit 1.
+
+    Defenders 0/1 are allied with one another; attackers 2/3 likewise.
+    Reserve, fled and dead units do not occupy a hex.
+    """
